---
// Picture first for "Columns for analytics": the same 10-column table, one query
// that needs 3 columns. A row layout reads every field of every row; a column
// layout reads only the three columns. Table shape is the post's sales table
// (10 columns); the 6 rows drawn are illustrative. Plain inline SVG, no ids.
import DiagramIcon from './DiagramIcon.astro';

const W = 900;
const H = 392;
const cols = 10;
const rowsN = 6;
const cw = 34;
const ch = 24;
const need = new Map([[1, 'store_id'], [4, 'sale_date'], [7, 'units']]);
const panels = [
  { x: 20, mode: 'row' as const },
  { x: 460, mode: 'col' as const },
];
const gy = 138;
---
<figure class="rc">
  <div class="rc-scroll">
  <svg viewBox={`0 0 ${W} ${H}`} role="img" aria-label="The same ten-column table read two ways for one query that needs three columns: store, date and units. A row layout reads every field of every row, ten of ten columns. A column layout reads only the three columns, three of ten.">
    <text x="20" y="24" class="rc-h">
      <tspan data-lang-en>One query, two layouts</tspan>
      <tspan data-lang-vi>Một truy vấn, hai cách lưu</tspan>
    </text>
    <text x="20" y="46" class="rc-sub">
      <tspan data-lang-en>Units sold per store in March. It needs 3 of the table's 10 columns.</tspan>
      <tspan data-lang-vi>Số sản phẩm bán được mỗi cửa hàng trong tháng 3. Chỉ cần 3 trong 10 cột của bảng.</tspan>
    </text>

    {panels.map((p) => (
      <g>
        <DiagramIcon name={p.mode === 'row' ? 'file' : 'db'} x={p.x + 16} y={80} size={26} />
        <text x={p.x + 40} y={85} class="rc-t">
          {p.mode === 'row' ? (
            <>
              <tspan data-lang-en>Stored by row: every field is read</tspan>
              <tspan data-lang-vi>Lưu theo dòng: đọc mọi trường</tspan>
            </>
          ) : (
            <>
              <tspan data-lang-en>Stored by column: only 3 are read</tspan>
              <tspan data-lang-vi>Lưu theo cột: chỉ đọc 3 cột</tspan>
            </>
          )}
        </text>

        {[...need.entries()].map(([c, name]) => (
          <text x={p.x + 10 + c * cw + cw / 2} y={gy - 8} text-anchor="middle" class="rc-mono">{name}</text>
        ))}

        {Array.from({ length: rowsN }).map((_, r) =>
          Array.from({ length: cols }).map((_, c) => {
            const used = need.has(c);
            const cls = p.mode === 'row' ? 'rc-cell is-hot' : used ? 'rc-cell is-hit' : 'rc-cell is-skip';
            return <rect x={p.x + 10 + c * cw + 1} y={gy + r * ch + 1} width={cw - 2} height={ch - 2} rx="2" class={cls} />;
          }),
        )}

        <text x={p.x + 10} y={gy + rowsN * ch + 30} class={p.mode === 'row' ? 'rc-v is-hot' : 'rc-v is-hit'}>
          {p.mode === 'row' ? (
            <>
              <tspan data-lang-en>10 of 10 columns read</tspan>
              <tspan data-lang-vi>Đọc 10 trên 10 cột</tspan>
            </>
          ) : (
            <>
              <tspan data-lang-en>3 of 10 columns read</tspan>
              <tspan data-lang-vi>Đọc 3 trên 10 cột</tspan>
            </>
          )}
        </text>
        <text x={p.x + 10} y={gy + rowsN * ch + 52} class="rc-note">
          {p.mode === 'row' ? (
            <>
              <tspan data-lang-en>The reader gets through every byte of every line.</tspan>
              <tspan data-lang-vi>Trình đọc đi qua từng byte của từng dòng.</tspan>
            </>
          ) : (
            <>
              <tspan data-lang-en>The seven other columns are never touched.</tspan>
              <tspan data-lang-vi>Bảy cột còn lại không bị đụng tới.</tspan>
            </>
          )}
        </text>
      </g>
    ))}

    <line x1="20" x2={W - 20} y1="352" y2="352" class="rc-rule" />
    <text x="20" y="376" class="rc-note">
      <tspan data-lang-en>Only six rows are drawn; the real table has 10 million. Fewer columns read means less disk and less memory.</tspan>
      <tspan data-lang-vi>Hình chỉ vẽ sáu dòng; bảng thật có 10 triệu dòng. Đọc ít cột hơn nghĩa là ít đĩa và ít RAM hơn.</tspan>
    </text>
  </svg>
  </div>
  <figcaption>
    <span data-lang-en>Red cells are bytes read for nothing; gold cells are the only ones the query needs.</span>
    <span data-lang-vi>Ô đỏ là byte đọc phí; ô vàng là những ô duy nhất truy vấn cần.</span>
  </figcaption>
</figure>

<style>
  .rc { margin: 2em 0; width: 100%; }
  .rc-scroll { overflow-x: auto; }
  .rc svg { display: block; width: 100%; min-width: 640px; height: auto; }
  .rc text { font-size: 14px; fill: var(--text-body); }
  .rc .rc-h { font-size: 16px; font-weight: 700; fill: var(--text); }
  .rc .rc-sub { fill: var(--text-muted); }
  .rc .rc-t { font-size: 14px; font-weight: 700; fill: var(--text); }
  .rc .rc-mono { font-family: ui-monospace, SFMono-Regular, Menlo, Monaco, Consolas, monospace; font-size: 11px; fill: var(--text-body); }
  .rc .rc-v { font-weight: 700; }
  .rc .rc-v.is-hot { fill: var(--red); }
  .rc .rc-v.is-hit { fill: var(--gold-icon); }
  .rc .rc-note { font-size: 13px; fill: var(--text-muted); }
  .rc-rule { stroke: var(--border); }
  .rc-cell { stroke-width: 1; }
  .rc-cell.is-hot { fill: var(--red-tint-bg); stroke: var(--red); }
  .rc-cell.is-hit { fill: var(--gold-tint-bg); stroke: var(--gold-icon); stroke-width: 1.4; }
  .rc-cell.is-skip { fill: var(--bg-alt); stroke: var(--border); stroke-dasharray: 3 3; }
  .rc figcaption { margin-top: 10px; font-size: 14px; color: var(--text-muted); line-height: 1.55; text-align: center; }
</style>
